description=Bluetooth support for ECARX E02 / IHU717P based Geely and Knewstar head units at the stock app path: A2DP Sink, HFP HF Client, PBAP Client, AVRCP Controller with working track metadata and physical media buttons (native libbluetooth.so AVRCP feature-negotiation fix), CarPlay/GOC watchdog.
